{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e05-scene-15",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "幕后的高手过招  (A Chess Match Behind the Scenes)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Armed with Chun Yuqiao's feedback, Bu Xiaogu presents her polished proposal to Xin Huimei's fan-club president, winning him over so completely that he cancels rival network ME on the spot. Listen to Xiaogu and Xingzi in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "许先生您好，现在可以见面吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您看完修改后的方案，觉得怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢夸奖，我们已经尽力改进了每一个细节。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您说谁是菜鸟呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你这是性别歧视，还是年龄歧视，还是阶层地位歧视啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我们的合作就算正式定下来了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，好消息，粉红哥把对手那边给拒了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他们已经取消了今夜现场的通告，决定来录我们的文娱论。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "太好了，跟淳于总说一下吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "无论如何，这次一定要让爱美会顺利上节目。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "许先生您好，现在可以见面吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello Mr Xu, are you free to meet right now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您看完修改后的方案，觉得怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'After reading the revised proposal, what do you think?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢夸奖，我们已经尽力改进了每一个细节。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you for the compliment; we did our best to refine every detail.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您说谁是菜鸟呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who are you calling a rookie?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你这是性别歧视，还是年龄歧视，还是阶层地位歧视啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is that gender bias, age bias, or status bias?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我们的合作就算正式定下来了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then our collaboration is officially settled!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，好消息，粉红哥把对手那边给拒了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingzi, great news — Brother Fenhong turned down the rival network!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他们已经取消了今夜现场的通告，决定来录我们的文娱论。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They already cancelled Tonight Live and decided to record our Entertainment Talk.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "太好了，跟淳于总说一下吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wonderful; go let Mr Chun Yuqiao know.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "无论如何，这次一定要让爱美会顺利上节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No matter what, we must get the fan club onto our show smoothly this time.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "许先生您好，现在可以见面吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您看完修改后的方案，觉得怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢夸奖，我们已经尽力改进了每一个细节。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
